    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibengwe lya ntemi Senakelibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'īnè gwa būsugi wa ntemi Hezekia, ntemi Senakelibu wa Ashulu akīdumīla pyī ī mizengo ya mu sī ya Yuda, īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu kūshisha wīdima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūntūma ntaale wa bashilikale bakwe, kūfuma Lakishi, ūja ī Yelusalemi alī n'ibità itaale lya bashilikale, kūnsanga ū ntemi Hezekiya. Ū ntaale wa bashilikale ūūkīmīīla ha nzīla ya kūja kwilaale lya mfuji wa myenda, haho na ngoka gwa kūfuma kwilambo lya kū ngūngūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntaale wa batūmami ba ng'wikūlū, Eliakimu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hilikia, ūja ko kūmona; walī na ba Shebuna, ng'wandīki, na Yoa, ng'wana Asafu, ūyo walī kalaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa bashilikale ūbawīla, Ū Hezekiya ng'wīlagi gīkī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū ntemi ntaale, ū ntemi wa Ashulu, alīhaya: Ūlī na kūsanya kī nose wīte lūgiili giili gīko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūkwikumīlījaga ūhaya gīkī ī mihayo yako īhelilwe chiza, na gīkī ūlī n'ibità lya nguzu; tūhaya ī yenīyo mihayo dūhū ndūhū mo nū gwa ng'hana! Ī gīsī ūyo ūkūng'wisagīlagwa nani nose ūlīnigomela ū nene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī, ī Misili īyo ūkwīsanyaga īlī gītī nang'ha gwibīngobīngo lībīnzīkile, īlo ūlū munhū ūlīdima hūna ūlīsendamīla līshikile kūnchima mu shiganza lyūlibīla! Ū Falao, ū ntemi wa Misili h'ūmo alī ū kū bose abo bakansendamīlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūūlū ūnishokeje, “A bise tūnsanije SEEBA Mulungu wise;” ī gīsī atī ng'wene ūyo Hezekiya wīngije mapandī gakwe ga higūlya, na myalīlo yakwe, hūna ūgwa kūbawīla banhu ba Yuda nī Yelusalemu, “A bing'we shing'wigeleelilwe kūyūlamya kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo ūyū dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī haha egaga shose shose ū kūlī baba būgonzo, ū ntemi wa Ashulu; ū nene neega falasa shihūmbī shibīlī, ūlū ūdūla ū bebe kūpandīka bashilikale ba kūjidamhīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūkwisagīlagwa kūpandīka magogoteni ga būlūgū na badamhīji ba falasa kūfuma Misili, ūdūgije gete kūng'wīmīla nūūlū ūmò wa batūmami ba ng'wa baba būgonzo a bado bado? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī a higūlya ya yenīyo, ū bebe ūliganika naabūūkile dūhū ū nene ū kwiza kwīdumīla na kwīkenaagūla ī sī yenīyī, nū SEEBA yaya ū kūmana? Angū ū SEEBA ng'wenekīlī h'ūyo waniwīlile, “Īsangage ī sī yenīyo, ūkīkenaagūle.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ba Eliakimu, Shebuna nū Yoa, būng'wīla ū ntaale wa bashilikale, “Ka nahene shi lūūlū baba nkūjiwa tūlīkwikūmbīlīja ūtūwīle a bise batūmami bako mu lūlīmi lwa Shialamayo, nguno tūlūmanile. Yaya ū kūtūwīla mu lūlīmi lwa Shiyudaya, kūnū baliigwa na a banhū abo balī ha ndugu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntaale wa bashilikale ūbashokeja, “A bing'we muliganika ū baba būgonzo wanitūmile ū nene kwiza kwīhaya ī mihayo yenīyī kūlī sīng'we būgonzo na bing'we dūhu, yaya ū kū banhū abo balī ha ndugu? Ū nene nalībawīla na a benabo, nguno nabo shibigeleelilwe balye maashi gabo na kūng'wa mine gabo, gīt'ūmo mukwītīla dūhū a bing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntaale wa bashilikale ng'wenūyo ūbūūka, ūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya mu lūlīmi lwa Bayudaya akūhayaga, “Bing'we yigwaagi ī mihayo ya ntemi ntaale, ū ntemi wa Ashulu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi alīhaya gīkī, ‘Lekagi ū kūnzunīlīja ū Hezekiya ikale akūmulembagūlaga; nguno atī nabo ū būdūla wa kūmupīja!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo yaya gete ū kūnzunīlīja ū Hezekiya ikale ūmulemba mihayo ya kūnsanya SEEBA; akūmuwīlaga gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA akūtūpīja dūhū, ū nzengo gwenūyū gūtūtūūlwa mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Ashulu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekagi ū kūndegeleka ū Hezekia; ū ntemi wa Ashulu alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nzūgi kūnū kūlī nene tūlomane mihayo ya kūtūūla mhola. Hūna būlī ūmò wing'we akūlya matwajo ga mizabibu yakwe, na ga mitiini yakwe, na akūng'wa minzī ga mu lwizī lwakwe ng'wenekīlī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūshisha aho nalizīle kūmusola namutwale kū sī ya kūbiza gītī ī ying'we yenīyo; sī ya shilīwa na divai ningī, sī ya būgalī būtī bo kūshila na migūnda ya mizabibu ya būyaga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekagi ū kūndegeleka ū Hezekia, nguno alīmujimīīja kūlwa kwikala ūmuwīla gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA akūtūpīja.’ Ī gīsī alīho mulungu kī w'ihanga lyose lyose ūyo wabīta kūpīja sī yakwe kūfuma mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Ashulu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamulungu ba Hamasi na Alipadi balī halī? Al'a bamulungu ba Sefavaimu nabo balī halī? Angū, bakadūja ū kwīpīja ī Samalia ū kūfuma ū mu nkono gwane? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu bamulungu bose a ba mu sī jenīji, nani ūyo wabīta kūpīja sī yakwe kūfuma mu nkono gwane? Al'ū SEEBA lūūlū, ū ng'wene akūdūgīja he ū kwīpīja ī Yelusalemu ū kūfuma ū mu nkono gwane?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū balī sele sele dūhū, batanshokegije mhayo gose gose; nguno ū ntemi walī wabalagīja ūbawīla, “Mutizūnshokeja mhayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntaale wa batūmami ba ng'wikūlū, ū Eliakimu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hilikia, nū Shebuna, ū ng'wandīki, nū Yoa, ng'wana Asafu, ūyo walī kalaani, būja ū kūlī Hezekia; būūkampuunīla ī shizwalo shabo shitandagūkile, būng'wīla īyo akīhaya ū ntaale wa bashilikale ng'wenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
